WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.180 line:72%
Ho ho ho!

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.720 line:72%
Hello Isla,
it's Father Christmas here,

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.400 line:72%
calling all the way
from the North Pole!

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.900 line:72%
I hear you swam
a whole length this year.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:11.880 line:72%
Brilliant!

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.760 line:72%
Did you go all the way
without stopping?

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.380 line:72%
Do you know what?

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.460 line:72%
Dasher tried swimming
in the reindeer pond

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.380 line:72%
and came out wearing
a lily pad as a hat.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.740 line:72%
Oh, how that made me chuckle!

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.660 line:72%
You earned a gold star
for reading,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.380 line:72%
and you helped
your little brother tidy up.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.420 line:72%
Both are kind,
clever things to do.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.920 line:72%
Give Amara and Theo
a big wave from me.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.200 line:72%
You wished for a red bike.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.420 line:72%
What a wish!

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.280 line:72%
I'll see what the elves can do.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.440 line:72%
Tonight, snuggle down and dream
of sleigh bells in the snow.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.160 line:72%
Merry Christmas, Isla!
